  "body": "- app_test job, legs floor (streamlit==1.56.0) and newest, resource_class\n  medium, only on develop, master and ci/*; installs the wheel of the commit\n  plus streamlit/plotly/pyyaml/pytest in one pip call, runs the suite minus\n  browser/source_tree with the provenance lock and the new app-deps lock\n- .circleci/check_app_skips.py: skips must be exactly the 5 allowed junit ids\n- tests/conftest.py: CYCLOPHASER_REQUIRE_APP_DEPS (off = no change, no import)\n- test_compare_core: SAMPLE_DIR -> versioned tests/s\u2026",
